        {
          "text": "Oyo uuzunda uyoosamikwa zikobela zituba, nsikooyoolizimaanya izina lyakwe mubbuku lyabuumi, pele njoolizumina izina lyakwe kubusyu bwa-Taata akubusyu bwabaangelo bakwe. ",
