        {
          "text": "Bona, njookupa abo basimbungano ya-Saatani balyaamba kuti tuli ba-Juda, anukuti tabali ba-Juda, balabeja buyo, njoobaboozya kuti bakombe kumaulu aako, bazibe kuti ndakakuyanda. ",
